#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Arthur Conan Doyle|title=When the World Screamed|url=http://gutenberg.net.au/ebooks01/0100031h.html|year=1929|passage=Surely that picture will be fixed for ever, for I heard the cameras '''clicking''' round me like crickets in a field.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261008014800/http://gutenberg.net.au/ebooks01/0100031h.html|archivedate=8 October 2026}}
