# {{lb|en|dated|intransitive}} To [[tick]].
#* {{RQ:Goldsmith Deserted Village|passage=the varnish'd clock that '''click'd''' behind the door}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|India}} To [[take]] (a [[photograph]]) with a [[camera]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2014|author=Dhisti Desai|title=Innocent Desire|page=107
|passage=Brad immediately took out his Iphone{{sic}} and '''clicked''' a picture of the plant and posted it up on Google and clicked search.}}
